  message: "Staleness audit 2026-07-21: part (b) is DONE -- the 2026-07-15 concept-audit (AFTER this item was filed) rewrote the run_signature/repo_fingerprint docstrings (ir.py:10-13/30-33, Readership note at 267) to state they are 'external provenance ... with no internal consumers', which is exactly the fate-decision the item requested. Part (a) remains: puppet/robot/rst/meson/purescript/racket/matlab stamp toolchain={'name':'<language>'} while tree-sitter analyzers default to 'python' via _get_python_toolchain (base.py:2501). Re-scoped to part (a) cosmetics only."  # a329
