  message: "FIXED in GitHub PR #17 (dev 791a8226fc). 8 Python-implemented analyzers (matlab/robot/racket/purescript/puppet/rst/meson in lang-common; circom in lang-extended1) hand-set AnalysisRun.toolchain={'name':'<language>','version':'unknown'}, mislabeling the analyzed LANGUAGE as the analyzing TOOLCHAIN. All 8 now use _get_python_toolchain() (real interpreter version). Cosmetic -- toolchain.name feeds only run_signature (no internal consumer, recomputed at finalize), no schema bump. circom test updated (circom->python); no other analyzer test locked a toolchain name. Tracker said 7; the 8th (circom, lang-extended1) was missed by the count. G2 now COMPLETE: WI-kapul wont_do (G1 by-design), META-nomiz satisfied #15, WI-zugol done #17, INV-jidat/dubam/rukor satisfied, META-niguz pending_validation."  # 653d
